  "plain": "At Hart Canyon near Aztec, New Mexico, where a flying saucer is said to have crashed in 1948 with alien bodies aboard, an aerial view of the area reportedly shows trees that were replanted in neat lines. Scott Ramsey, who has spent years investigating the site, says he and others later got to see that aerial view. To him it suggests that someone cleaned up and replanted the crash site to hide the damage."
